# Copy to .env.local only if you need to override the defaults.
# See SUPABASE_SETUP.md.
#
# Both of these already have working defaults in client/src/lib/formHandler.ts,
# because both are public: the project URL and the publishable key are sent with
# every request the browser makes. Set them here only to point a local build at
# a different project.
#
# Never put an sb_secret_ or service_role key in a VITE_ variable. Those bypass
# row-level security, and every VITE_ variable is compiled into a bundle the
# public can read.

# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://uqhgatgzgsnooanlfurs.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
